## 028-settings-fields-and-account (contracts/fluent-strings.md): pt-BR values
## for this feature's new keys. Not yet a shipped locale (`tr`/`tr_args`
## still resolve against en-US only) — this bundle exists so the
## `fluent_keys` parity test proves every key here has a matching pt-BR
## translation, ready for when a locale switch ships.

